      "content": "iv tried those things though. i take breaks, i try to talk, i try to sleep... but i just wake up feeling just as drained. it's like the world is just too loud and too much, and no amount of sleep is ever gonna fix how much i just want it all to be quiet. it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy weight around forever and there's no point to it.",
